y growth without caching bias.\n     - Separate Verify Sandbox Setup from Verify Cleanup so all $2 \\times M \\times N$ containers (live + clones) run simultaneously at rest, giving pure \"time to start verify\" and true peak RAM.\n     - Generate publication-quality thesis figures for the top 5 requested graphs.\n   - **Scope:** 9 scenarios per image (Test 1 Baseline $M=1, N=1$ [10 cycles], $N=5$ bridges $(2,5), (5,5)$, and Tier 3 high-load $(2,7), (2,10), (5,7), (5,10), (10,2), (10,5)$, scaling up to 100 peak concurrent containers).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Code & API Updates (Completed & Active on `debian@192.168.0.199`):**\n     - Updated `services/challenges.py` and `api/challenges.py` with `POST /teams/{k}/verificator?skip_cleanup=true` and `DELETE /teams/{k}/verificator` (`cleanup_verify_sandbox`).\n     - Fixed `ovn.py` to pass `ip_address=ip_addr` to `engine.connect_network(clone_name, self.net_name, ip_address=ip_addr)`, eliminating OVN dynamic address pool lock contention (`Insufficient dynamic addresses allocated`).\n     - Created `resource_sampler.py` (100ms Python subprocess sampling `/proc/stat`, `/proc/meminfo`, `/proc/spl/kstat/zfs/arcstats`).\n     - Created `benchmark_suite.py` with 6 synchronized barriers, exporting `_results.csv`, `_step_resources.csv`, `_timeseries.csv`, `_raw_samples.csv`, and `_report.md`.\n   - **Image Baking (Completed):**\n     - Built `ubuntu-heavy` (544.18 MiB compressed, fingerprint `e5b450ebc04f`) on Incus with `systemd`, `nginx`, `postgresql-16`, `sqlite3`, `python3` and registered in `blueagent.db`.\n   - **Benchmark Executions (100% Pass Rate across 18 Scenarios):**\n     - `thesis_alpine`: 9 scenarios completed (108 step resource rows, 8,634 timeseries samples).\n     - `thesis_ubuntu`: 9 scenarios completed (108 step resource rows, 10,833 timeseries samples).\n     - Datasets stored at `/home/debian/bluectfd/blueagent/tests/` and synced locally to `/home/davidel/.gemini/antigravity/brain/335ea41a-df46-4ffa-bb4c